SUMMARY:🏇🎉 A DAY AT THE RACES AT WOODBINE RACETRACK! 🎉🏇
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🏇
 🎉 A DAY AT THE RACES AT WOODBINE RACETRACK! 🎉🏇\n\nFast Horses\, B
 ig Excitement & One of Our Most Popular Events\nIf you've never been to th
 e horse races before\, you're missing out on one of Toronto's most unique 
 and entertaining afternoons.\n\nThere is something surprisingly exciting a
 bout watching these incredible athletes thunder down the track at full spe
 ed while thousands of people cheer them on.\n\nWhether you're placing a be
 t\, cheering for a horse based on its name\, or simply soaking in the atmo
 sphere\, it's always a fun day out.\n\nThe best part? You don't need to kn
 ow anything about horse racing to enjoy it.\n\nMany of our members come fo
 r the social experience\, the excitement\, and the chance to try something
  completely different. Over the years this has become one of our most popu
 lar annual events\, and every time we go we have a fantastic afternoon tog
 ether.\nAnd yes... betting is part of the fun\, but it's completely option
 al. Some people bet\, some don't. Either way\, you'll have a great time.\n
 \n📲 **Join Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.what
 sapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n📖 Please Read Everything\nTh
 ere are TWO meetup options available.\n\n***\n\n🚍 TTC Meetup Option\n
 📍 Meetup Location: Islington Station Bus Platform under the 37 Islingto
 n Bus sign\n🫎 I'll be wearing my Moose Hat\n⏰ Meetup Time: 11:15 AM\n
 We are taking the 37 Islington Bus.\n🚌 Bus Leaves: 11:24 AM Sharp\nI wi
 ll only wait until the bus arrives.\nIf you miss the bus\, you will need t
 o make your own way to the racetrack.\n\n***\n\n🚗 Driving Meetup Option
 \n📍 Meetup Location: Outside of Gate 10 at Woodbine Racetrack\n⏰ Meet
 up Time: 12:15 PM\n🫎 I'll be wearing my Moose Hat\nThere is plenty of F
 REE parking available.\n\n***\n\n🏇 Race Information\n🏁 First Race: A
 pproximately 1:10 PM\n🏁 Last Race: Approximately 4:00 PM\nYou're welcom
 e to leave at any time.\n\n***\n\n🎟️ What We'll Do\n\nOnce everyone a
 rrives\, we'll find a spot together in the grandstand where we can enjoy t
 he races as a group.\n\nWe'll:\n🏇 Watch the races\n💵 Place bets (if 
 you'd like)\n🎉 Cheer for our horses\n😊 Enjoy the atmosphere\n🍔 Gr
 ab food and drinks if we feel like it\n\nFor those interested\, there is a
 lso a VIP seating area available for approximately $10 per person if the g
 roup decides we'd like to upgrade.\nMinimum bets start at just $2.\nAnd re
 member...\n\nYou do NOT have to bet to enjoy the experience.\nMany people 
 come just for the social outing and excitement.\n\n***\n\n🎒 What to Bri
 ng\n🪪 Government-issued ID\n💵 CASH if you plan to place bets\n⚠️
  Betting windows are cash only.\n🥪 Feel free to bring your own food and
  drinks.\nLet's bring a few snacks to share with the group!\n\n***\n\n📚
  New to Horse Racing?\nNever been before?\nPerfect.\nMost people haven't.\
 nI'll explain how everything works\, and you'll pick it up quickly.\nLearn
  more about betting on horses: Click Here!\n\n***\n\n🎟️ Meetup Fee: $
 5 cash in person or e-transfer to\n📧 [mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto
 :mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)\nThis fee helps support the group and allows u
 s to continue organizing events like this. Thank you for supporting commun
 ity! 💖\n\n***\n\n🌈 Who Is This For?\nThis group is open to anyone wh
 o wants to be social and make friends — whether single or not.\nWe also 
 host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽
 ️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere's always something happening.\n\n***\n\nR
 EMEMBER: You're welcome to just show up on the day if you're unsure about 
 your schedule.\nAnd as always\, sometimes things happen and events may nee
 d to be canceled — please keep an eye on updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 Organiz
 er: Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email\n📧 [torontomovie
 sandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)\nCome
  for the horses.\nStay for the excitement.\nLeave wondering why you didn't
  try this years ago. 🏇✨
