SUMMARY:🍦🦁 THE GREAT ST. CLAIR WEST ICE CREAM SAFARI! 🦁🍦
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🍦
 🦁 THE GREAT ST. CLAIR WEST ICE CREAM SAFARI! 🦁🍦\n\n**Six Sweet St
 ops\, Hidden Gems & One Delicious Summer Adventure**\n\nForget the zoo...\
 n\nThis summer\, we're going on an **Ice Cream Safari!**\nJoin us as we ex
 plore one of Toronto's sweetest neighbourhoods\, stopping at **seven incre
 dible dessert destinations** along St. Clair West.\n\nFrom authentic Itali
 an gelato and Turkish ice cream to outrageous sundaes and one of the quirk
 iest cafés in the city\, every stop has its own personality and something
  completely different to discover.\n\nThe stops are close together\, which
  means this isn't about racing from place to place—it's about taking our
  time\, sharing a few bites\, discovering new favourites\, and enjoying a 
 fun afternoon with great people.\n\n**Nobody is expected to buy something 
 at every stop.**\nThink of it as a dessert tasting adventure. Share with f
 riends\, sample something new\, or simply enjoy the walk and the company.\
 nThe entire safari will take approximately **3 hours**.\n\n📲 **Don't Fo
 rget to Join Our WhatsApp Group – \\[CLICK HERE\\!\\]\\( Click here to j
 oin\\)**\n\n***\n\n## 🍦 Our Safari Stops\n\n💩 **Poop Café** – Our
  starting point! One of Toronto's most unique cafés\, famous for its play
 ful décor\, bubble waffles\, colourful desserts\, and ice cream served wi
 th a sense of humour. It's impossible not to laugh here.\n\n🍨 **Aura Ge
 lato Artigianale** – Small-batch artisan gelato crafted the traditional 
 Italian way using premium ingredients for rich\, authentic flavours.\nstyl
 e granitas that are perfect on a warm summer afternoon.\n\n🍌 **Bar Ape 
 Gelato** – One of Toronto's most celebrated gelato makers\, known for ha
 ndcrafted frozen treats\, premium ingredients\, and creative seasonal flav
 ours that regularly attract long lineups.\n\n🍦 **Pink Ice Cream** – E
 xperience traditional Turkish-style ice cream\, where the fun begins befor
 e your first bite. Watching it being served is almost as entertaining as e
 ating it!\n\n🍨 **Dutch Dreams** – A true Toronto institution for over
  40 years. Famous for gigantic portions\, outrageous sundaes\, and colourf
 ul creations that have become a summer tradition for generations.\n\n🍦 
 **Booyah** – We'll finish at one of Toronto's favourite small-batch ice 
 cream shops\, known for creative flavours\, homemade waffle cones\, and so
 me of the city's best ice cream sandwiches.\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂️ Wha
 t We'll Do\n\nWe'll begin outside **The Poo Cafen** and slowly make our wa
 y along the neighbourhood\, visiting each dessert stop while enjoying one 
 of Toronto's most vibrant summer streets.\n\nAlong the way we'll:\n\n🍦 
 Discover seven unique dessert shops\n😋 Sample as much (or as little!) a
 s you'd like\n📸 Take lots of fun photos\n🚶 Enjoy a relaxed social wa
 lk\n😊 Meet new people and spend the afternoon together\nThis isn't a ch
 allenge—it's an adventure.\n\n***\n\n## 🌦️ Weather & Expectations\n
 \nThis event will happen in most summer weather conditions.\nIf severe wea
 ther or thunderstorms are expected\, the event may be cancelled.\nPlease d
 ress for the weather and wear comfortable walking shoes.\nThis is a social
  event\, not a race.\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Loc
 ation:** Outside **St. Clair West Subway Station**\n🫎 I'll be wearing m
 y **Moose Hat**\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** **1:00 PM**\nI will only wait **5 mi
 nutes.**\nEarly is on time.\nOn time is late.\n\nWe will leave promptly an
 d won't be able to spend time tracking down late arrivals.\n\n🏁 **End P
 oint:** St. Clair West Subway Station (approximately **4:00 PM**)\n\n***\n
 \n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **[ma
 thewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\nThis fee hel
 ps support the group and allows us to continue organizing events like this
 . Thank you for supporting our community! 💖\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to B
 ring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n💳 Spending money fo
 r treats\n😄 Your sweet tooth!\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThi
 s group is open to anyone who wants to be social and make friends—whethe
 r single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 A
 rts & culture outings\n🍽️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere's always somet
 hing happening.\n\n***\n\nREMEMBER: You're welcome to just show up on the 
 day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes plans change and even
 ts may need to be cancelled\, so please keep an eye on the event page for 
 updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 **Organizer:** Mathew\nQuestions? Post on the even
 t wall or email:\n📧 **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:toro
 ntomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)**\n\n**Come for the safari. Stay for the 
 gelato. Leave with a new favourite ice cream shop... and probably a brain 
 freeze.** 🍦🦁✨
